<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CIVIC DETECTIVE - Media Pembelajaran PPKn Kelas XII</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <!-- Canvas Confetti for Solved / Award celebrations -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        detective: {
                            bg: '#0f141c',
                            card: '#1a2332',
                            board: '#2a1a08',
                            amber: '#f59e0b',
                            cyan: '#06b6d4',
                            crimson: '#ef4444',
                            emerald: '#10b981',
                            gold: '#fbbf24'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['Courier New', 'monospace']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Courier+Prime:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap');

        body {
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #e6edf3;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-image: radial-gradient(#1f293d 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 24px 24px;
        }

        .corkboard {
            background: #23160a url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/cork-board.png');
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            border: 12px solid #3d230d;
        }

        /* Card Flip Effect */
        .perspective-1000 {
            perspective: 1000px;
        }
        .transform-style-3d {
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
        }
        .backface-hidden {
            backface-visibility: hidden;
        }
        .rotate-y-180 {
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }

        /* Secret Stamp Animation */
        .stamp-top-secret {
            border: 4px dashed #ef4444;
            color: #ef4444;
            transform: rotate(-12deg);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
        }

        /* String animation in Canvas */
        #string-canvas {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #111827;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #374151;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #f59e0b;
        }

        /* Printable Area CSS */
        @media print {
            body * {
                visibility: hidden;
            }
            #printable-section, #printable-section * {
                visibility: visible;
            }
            #printable-section {
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                top: 0;
                width: 100%;
                color: #000 !important;
                background: #fff !important;
            }
            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .page-break {
                page-break-after: always;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-amber-500 selection:text-black">

    <header class="bg-gray-900/90 border-b border-gray-800 sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-amber-500/20 p-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-400">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-7 h-7"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-black tracking-wider text-amber-400 uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
                        CIVIC DETECTIVE
                        <span class="text-xs bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-normal">PPG Prajabatan Edition</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Media Pembelajaran Hak & Kewajiban Warga Negara (UUD NRI 1945) • XII TKR 1</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Navigation Bar Tabs -->
            <nav class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-gray-950 p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-sm font-medium">
                <button onclick="switchTab('board')" id="nav-board" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30">
                    <i data-lucide="layout" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Papan Investigasi
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('cases')" id="nav-cases" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800">
                    <i data-lucide="folder-search" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Map Kasus (5)
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('challenges')" id="nav-challenges" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800">
                    <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Tantangan
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('surprises')" id="nav-surprises" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800">
                    <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Kartu Kejutan
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('trial')" id="nav-trial" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800">
                    <i data-lucide="gavel" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Sidang Detektif
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('modul')" id="nav-modul" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800">
                    <i data-lucide="file-text" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Modul & Cetak
                </button>
            </nav>

            <!-- Quick Audio Synth & Timer Controls -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <button id="sfx-toggle" onclick="toggleAudio()" class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white border border-gray-700" title="Efek Suara On/Off">
                    <i data-lucide="volume-2" id="sfx-icon" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="bg-gray-950 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 animate-pulse"></i>
                    <span id="timer-display" class="font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">90:00</span>
                    <button onclick="toggleTimer()" id="timer-btn" class="ml-1 text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-500/30 rounded border border-amber-500/40">Start</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN CONTAINER -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 flex-1 w-full">

        <section id="tab-board" class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Top Controls & Case Overview Bar -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                <div class="md:col-span-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 font-semibold block">Kasus Aktif Diinvestigasi:</span>
                        <h2 id="active-case-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="file-warning" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Kasus 1: SEKOLAH YANG TIDAK LAYAK
                        </h2>
                        <p id="active-case-pasal" class="text-xs text-cyan-400 mt-0.5">Konstitusi Terkait: UUD NRI 1945 Pasal 31 (Hak Pendidikan)</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <label class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Pilih Kasus:</label>
                        <select id="case-select" onchange="changeActiveCase(this.value)" class="bg-gray-950 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 text-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none">
                            <option value="1">Kasus 1: Sekolah Tidak Layak (Pasal 31)</option>
                            <option value="2">Kasus 2: Jejak Digital (Pasal 28G)</option>
                            <option value="3">Kasus 3: Aturan Untuk Siapa? (Pasal 27)</option>
                            <option value="4">Kasus 4: Suara Yang Dibungkam (Pasal 28E/28J)</option>
                            <option value="5">Kasus 5: Pelayanan Untuk Siapa? (Pasal 27)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase">Target Investigasi</div>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 mt-1" id="active-case-target">Pemenuhan Hak Pendidikan Layak</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 p-2 rounded-lg">
                        <i data-lucide="target" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Visual Corkboard Area with String connections and Pins -->
            <div class="relative corkboard rounded-2xl p-6 min-h-[520px] overflow-hidden border-4 border-amber-950 shadow-2xl">
                <canvas id="string-canvas"></canvas>

                <!-- Corkboard Header Banner -->
                <div class="absolute top-4 left-6 z-20 bg-gray-950/90 border-2 border-red-600/80 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-600 animate-ping"></div>
                    <span class="font-mono text-red-500 font-bold tracking-widest text-sm">CRIME SCENE INVESTIGATION BOARD</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Top Secret Stamp -->
                <div class="absolute top-6 right-8 z-20 stamp-top-secret font-mono font-black text-xl px-4 py-1 rounded">
                    CONFIDENTIAL / PPG EXAM
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Evidence Cards Grid on Canvas -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 mt-12 relative z-20" id="evidence-cards-container">
                    <!-- Evidence Cards 1-5 will be injected here dynamically -->
                </div>

                <!-- Status Banner Bottom Board -->
                <div class="mt-8 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-amber-500/30 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 z-20 relative">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="info" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400"></i>
                        <span>Setiap kelompok membutuhkan <strong class="text-amber-400">minimal 3 Bukti</strong> sebelum menekan tombol <strong class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">"SOLVED!"</strong>. Risiko <em>False Alarm (-10 Poin)</em> jika kurang analisis!</span>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="openSolveModal()" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-400/50 flex items-center gap-2 transform active:scale-95 transition">
                        <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-5 h-5">="</i> PERNYATAAN SOLVED!
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-gray-800">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="p-2 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/40">
                            <i data-lucide="users" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Klasemen & Status 5 Tim Detektif</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Kelas XII TKR 1 • Pemantauan Real-time Skor & Bukti Terkumpul</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="resetScores()" class="text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-red-400 underline flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" class="w-3 h-3"></i> Reset Poin
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4" id="team-scoreboard-container">
                    <!-- Teams 1 to 5 dynamically rendered -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tab-cases" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="archive" class="w-7 h-7"></i> ARSIP KASUS HAK & KEWAJIBAN WARGA NEGARA
                </h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">Pilih kasus untuk melihat deskripsi lengkap, kronologi, bukti pendukung, dan target analisis sesuai UUD NRI 1945.</p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" id="all-cases-grid">
                    <!-- Rendered 5 detailed case cards dynamically -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tab-challenges" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-800">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400"></i> KARTU TANTANGAN DETEKTIF (1 - 5)
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Disimpan Guru. Berikan tantangan ini saat kelompok ingin mendapatkan bukti tambahan atau poin bonus!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">
                        Reward: +10 / +15 Poin & 1 Kartu Bukti
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" id="challenges-grid">
                    <!-- Challenges 1-5 Cards -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tab-surprises" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400"></i> KARTU KEJUTAN DETEKTIF
                </h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-mx-auto mb-8">
                    Uji dinamika kelompok dengan kejutan tak terduga! Diputar acak oleh Guru di pertengahan ronde investigasi untuk menciptakan simulasi situasi nyata.
                </p>

                <div class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-gray-950 border border-amber-500/30 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl relative">
                    <div id="surprise-display" class="min-h-[180px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3">
                        <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-16 h-16 text-amber-500/50 animate-bounce"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-300">Siap Mengambil Kejutan?</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Klik tombol di bawah untuk mengundi 1 dari 6 Kartu Kejutan.</p>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="drawSurpriseCard()" class="mt-6 w-full py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-400 text-black font-black text-lg rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transform active:scale-95 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="dices" class="w-5 h-5"></i> UNDI KARTU KEJUTAN
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tab-trial" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-800">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="gavel" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400"></i> SIDANG AKHIR DETEKTIF
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Sesi Presentasi Laporan Kasus & Debat Antar Kelompok (Maksimal 2 Menit/Kelompok)</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="generateAwards()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-500 text-black font-bold rounded-lg text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="award" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Ucapkan Pemenang & Penghargaan
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- Template Pertanyaan Sidang -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="clipboard-list" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Panduan Laporan Detektif (Format Presentasi)
                        </h3>
                        <ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300 list-decimal list-inside">
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Masalah Utama:</strong> Apa inti persoalan dalam kasus ini?</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Hak Warga Negara:</strong> Hak apa yang terlanggar / berkaitan?</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Kewajiban Warga Negara:</strong> Kewajiban apa yang diingkari / harus dijalankan?</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Klasifikasi:</strong> Pelanggaran hak, pengingkaran kewajiban, atau keduanya?</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Landasan Hukum:</strong> Pasal UUD NRI Tahun 1945 apa yang mendukung?</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Solusi Konkret:</strong> Apa tindakan/solusi terbaik yang kamu tawarkan?</li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Papan Gelar Penghargaan -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="trophy" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Gelar Detektif (PPG PRAJABATAN)
                            </h3>
                            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm" id="awards-display">
                                <div class="p-2.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">🏆 MASTER DETECTIVE</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400" id="award-master">Belum ditentukan</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="p-2.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">🔎 BEST EVIDENCE</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400" id="award-evidence">Belum ditentukan</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="p-2.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">🧠 CRITICAL DETECTIVE</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400" id="award-critical">Belum ditentukan</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="p-2.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold">🤝 BEST TEAMWORK</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400" id="award-teamwork">Belum ditentukan</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tab-modul" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 no-print">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-800">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="printer" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-400"></i> CETAK KARTU FISIK & MODUL AJAR PPG
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Unduh/Cetak perangkat pembelajaran lengkap untuk kelas offline.</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="window.print()" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="printer" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Cetak Kit Lengkap (PDF)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Modul Info PPG -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <div class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase mb-1">Identitas Modul</div>
                        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Materi: Hak dan Kewajiban Warga Negara</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Kelas: XII TKR 1 | Alokasi: 2 x 45 Menit</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <div class="text-xs text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase mb-1">Tujuan Pembelajaran</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-300">Murid mampu menganalisis kasus, membedakan pelanggaran hak vs pengingkaran kewajiban, menghubungkan UUD NRI 1945 & menentukan solusi.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <div class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase mb-1">Rubrik Penilaian Skor</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-300">Masalah (15), Hak (15), Kewajiban (15), Bukti (20), UUD 1945 (15), Solusi (15), Kecepatan (5) = TOTAL 100 Poin.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Printable Layout Wrapper (Shown in Print Mode) -->
            <div id="printable-section" class="bg-white text-black p-6 rounded-xl">
                <div class="text-center border-b-2 border-black pb-4 mb-6">
                    <h1 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-wider">CIVIC DETECTIVE: KIT PERMAINAN PEMBELAJARAN</h1>
                    <p class="text-sm font-serif">Materi: Hak dan Kewajiban Warga Negara (UUD NRI Tahun 1945) • Kelas XII TKR 1</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Print Content Placeholder dynamically generated -->
                <div id="printable-cards-content" class="space-y-6">
                    <!-- Populated by JS -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Evidence View Modal -->
    <div id="evidence-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
